  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.3179 provides an architectural framework for machine learning (ML) model serving in future networks including IMT-2020, i.e., preparing and deploying ML models in different deployment environments to enable the application of ML model inference to ML underlay networks. The framework includes high-level requirements, and a high-level architecture description covering the definition of architectural components and reference points.</abstract>
